desc: The famous melody from the Ninth Symphony, in G, first position, on strings 2, 3 and 4 only.|第九交响曲中的著名旋律, G 调第一把位, 只用 2、3、4 弦.
desc: Tip: count the dotted rhythm at the end of each phrase carefully (one and a half beats + half a beat): "one - two and".|小贴士: 每句结尾的附点节奏 (一拍半 + 半拍) 要数清楚: "一 — 二 嗒".
